<title>USA: S&amp;P says to issue Raytheon news release on Monday.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P says to issue Raytheon news release on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rating agency Standard &amp; Poor's said on Monday it would issue a press release on Raytheon Co later in the day.</p>
<p>&quot;I do know there will be a release on Ratheon later today,&quot; said S&amp;P analyst Bruce Hyman.</p>
<p>&quot;Ultimately, the transaction was quite straight forward with regard to Texas Instruments so it was easier for us to simply release it,&quot; he added, referring to the announced sale of its defense business to Raytheon Co for $2.95 billion in cash.</p>
<p>Earlier, S&amp;P said it affirmed the single-A corporate credit and A1 commercial paper rating of Texas Instruments.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
